  "limitations": [
    "Preparation only. No runtime/controller/registry modification, upload, publication, user preview, or complete EXP-005 performance claim.",
    "Visible eye parts retain original hair-occlusion gaps. Separate optional inferred stroke-continuation objects fill only those gaps; every added pixel is labeled in its mask. Canonical hair remains in front.",
    "Upper/lower contour ownership and edge mattes are derived; original source patches were not clean independent parts.",
    "Mouth source-native rim exceeds the approved opening cap. Canonical proposal is explicitly inferred per-part curve registration; not source-authored canonical lips.",
    "Canonical mouth proposal proves peak aperture ownership only. It is not a continuous smile rig and must not be used as an emotion crossfade.",
    "Optional crease parts are disabled by default because fixed backing may already own a crease.",
    "Approved source teeth, their white pigment, and upper registration [533,626] are reused unchanged. A wide smile will need its reveal checked, not new teeth colored over the source.",
